<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Agrium cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Agrium cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it cut Agrium Inc to long-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said kept the intermediate-term rating as accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Agrium lost 1/8 to 11-3/8.</p>
</text>
